      "Yes — the regenerated package now incorporates the major review points and BB comments directly into the artifacts themselves instead of leaving them outside the package.\n\nKey incorporated changes now visible inside the documents:\n\n- Enterprise-depth BRD expansion instead of thin BRD fileciteturn1file4L1-L18\n- Sigma-style execution-control flows and screen/API/backend mapping added fileciteturn1file0L1-L1\n- BB review comments embedded into the package itself fileciteturn1file1L1-L24\n- Full traceability enhancement with:\n  - review linkage\n  - defect linkage\n  - release linkage\n  - AI evaluation linkage\n  - automation linkage\n  - compliance linkage fileciteturn1file3L1-L137\n- Naming standard corrected to:\n  `AT-Hack0020-P2-ChatGPT_Perplexity_` fileciteturn1file1L10-L18\n- Execution-control / anti-drift governance added explicitly fileciteturn1file4L252-L259\n- Demo sequence and enterprise rollout logic added fileciteturn1file4L274-L282\n- Architecture reality boundary and API governance added fileciteturn1file4L145-L152\n- Prompt governance lifecycle strengthened fileciteturn1file4L108-L127\n- Risks, mitigations, recovery paths expanded fileciteturn1file4L260-L272\n- Phase-exit governance gates expanded in traceability fileciteturn1file3L25-L47\n\nCurrent package now includes:\n\n1. BRD  \n2. Traceability  \n3. Master Matrix  \n4. Execution Control Book  \n5. BB Review Comments Register  \n6. TraceabilityMaster.xlsx  \n7. TraceabilityMulti.xlsx  \n8. MasterMatrix.xlsx  \n\nMain remaining improvement areas (optional, not blockers now):\n- UI wireframe sketches/screenshots\n- Sequence diagrams per API\n- Database ER diagram\n- Deployment topology diagram\n- CI/CD infra architecture\n- Role permission matrix\n- Non-functional requirements matrix\n- SLO/SLA table\n- Cost estimation model\n- Sprint-wise engineering allocation\n- Playwright/UAT automation mapping\n- Production observability dashboard specification\n\nThe package is now materially closer to an enterprise implementation-control set rather than only a hackathon BRD bundle."
     ]
