      "Prepared the consolidated execution-control document for MendoraCI.\n\nIt combines:\n- BRD\n- User stories\n- Sigma-style user flows\n- Screen mapping\n- API mapping\n- Backend services\n- Traceability\n- Phase gates\n- Governance controls\n- AI evaluation controls\n- Delivery guardrails\n- Anti-drift implementation structure\n\nThe structure is designed so:\n- developers cannot drift from requirements,\n- frontend/backend remain synchronized,\n- AI workflows stay governed,\n- and enterprise delivery evidence remains traceable end-to-end.\n\nPrimary format used:\n- Detailed Markdown execution book (best for Git + versioning + architecture reviews + AI-assisted coding workflows)\n\nThe document is prepared as an enterprise implementation-control artifact rather than a normal BRD."
     ]
