      "Prepared a separate downloadable markdown document containing the recommended next-stage enterprise improvements for MendoraCI.\n\nThe enhancement document includes:\n- UI/UX wireframe recommendations\n- Deployment topology additions\n- API sequence diagrams\n- ER/data lineage diagrams\n- RBAC matrix\n- Observability/SLO framework\n- Production governance additions\n- AI evaluation hardening\n- Cost and infra modeling\n- CI/CD rollout controls\n- UAT automation mapping\n- Enterprise buyer-readiness improvements\n- Future commercialization improvements\n- “must-have vs optional” prioritization\n\nIt is structured as:\n- immediate improvements,\n- pre-build governance improvements,\n- enterprise production improvements,\n- and post-hackathon commercialization improvements."
     ]
